Subject: [PATCH 02/29] --- Part 1: Add a facility to check for race conditions
 in unit tests

This PR is about fixing a race condition in the Garbage Collector of the
Gardener Resource Manager.

The following commits add a facility that will allow to reproduce the
given race condition in a unit test. This unit test will then be used to verify
that after the fix the race condition is resolved.

To facilitate the code review, a detailed documentation introduces the problem
of race conditions and shows how the Cooperative Executor could be used to write
unit tests for race conditions. The unit test of the Cooperative Executor itself
contains a simple example how it could be used.

Note that this component is only used for the unit tests and hence does not pose
a risk of introducing a regression in the productive aspect of the Garbage
Collector.

It is sufficient to read the documentation of the Cooperative Executor (next
commit) to understand the unit tests of the Garbage Collector. Understanding the
implementation details of the Cooperative Executor is not required when
reviewing the main aspect of this PR.
